<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  3.18%			 C/S =  2.54%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  3.39%			 O/N =  2.54%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.55%			 T/N =  2.54%</p>
<p>		   Jan  10, 1997			Jan  9, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.45%	1 month forward =  6.11%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.47%	2 month forward =  6.95%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  8.26%	3 month forward =  7.80%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.23%	4 month forward =  7.89%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.22%	5 month forward =  7.80%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.15%	6 month forward =  7.69%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
